    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31532" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰστοξεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shoot arrows at,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.49
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς. βιβλία ἐς τὸ στρατόπεδον</span>
			<i>shoot</i> papers <i>attached to arrows into..,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
