				48.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὁρώμενα τὰ πάθη ταῖς ψυχαῖς
					εἰστοξεύονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					3.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
